  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Empower AI applications with real-time, accurate search results tailored for LLMs and RAG",
    "splashDescription": "Building AI agents that use real-time web data is harder than it looks. Traditional scraping is fragile, and most search APIs return loosely related results with limited control. Tavily changes that with a search engine purpose-built for AI agents—fast, structured, and API-driven. Use this connector to extract web content in end-to-end business processes powered by Camunda.",
